  "name": "Bestow Curse",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Touch a creature: WIS save or it's cursed while you concentrate. Pick the curse: Disadvantage on checks and saves with one ability; Disadvantage on attack rolls against you; a WIS save at the start of each of its turns or it must take the Dodge action; or an extra 1d8 Necrotic whenever you damage it with an attack roll or a spell. Higher slots lengthen the curse (the DM tracks that).</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
